      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH LEAK (2) is somehow still a maiden but rarely out of the finish recording six places from eight starts, the latest when second at this track. Has finished in the money the last two starts. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Well placed and gets her chance. PURE VENOM (3) is a first starter from the Robert Giltinan kennel by Barcia Bale out of One Trick Pony. Respect any strong moves in the market. RYEBUCK BANJO (4) shows ability but remains a maiden after nine starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing fourth (30.33) at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. LUCY LOU (6) returns here with a good chance to improve on last time.",
